   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The plural without a subject",
     "texto": [
      "In impersonal sentences with an unspecified agent, the third person plural is used in the present or future, or the plural in the past, without naming who acts: **Его уважают**, **Меня пригласили**, **Нас предупредят**. The person affected usually goes in the accusative.",
      "It is not the passive with a participle nor the form with **-ся**: the verb keeps an active plural form, but the agent is not identified. If it is named, it appears as the subject: **Меня пригласил директор** («I was invited by the director»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Passive or not?",
     "texto": [
      "If you want to say who did it, use the active form: **Меня пригласил директор** («the director invited me»). If it does not matter, use the plural: **Меня пригласили**. With verbs of communication it is very common: **Меня спросили** («I was asked»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
